<p>Net income per common</p>
<p>  and equivalent share   .55	   .51	1.49	 1.26</p>
<p>Common and equivalent</p>
<p>shares used in computing</p>
<p>  per share amounts   12,644	13,632    12,754     13,876</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 and 9 mos ended March 31, 1996 include a gain of $0.05/shr. Excluding the gain, operating earnings would have been $0.46/shr in Q3 1996 and $1.21/shr in 9 mos 1996.</p>
